e word I'm going with is \"Nodule.\"\n\nFinally, my sentence describing this finding is: The structure is a focal, roughly spherical opacity that appears and disappears over a few slices, distinguishing it from a continuous tubular vessel. Its diameter is approximately 7 mm.\n\n\n",
